# Online Prediction Server (Jetty, port 7010)
#
# JVM memory model mapping:
# - Heap: hot recent-history cache, trending windows, metrics ring buffers, request objects.
# - Thread stacks: request workers plus Kafka/Redis-adjacent call paths when enabled.
# - Metaspace/method area: Jetty, Jedis, service classes, serialization classes.
# - Code cache: JIT-compiled ranking, cache, and metrics hot paths.
-Xms768m
-Xmx1536m
-Xss512k
-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=320m
-XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=160m
-XX:MaxDirectMemorySize=256m
-XX:+UseG1GC
-XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=75
-XX:+UseStringDeduplication
-XX:+AlwaysPreTouch
-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError
-XX:HeapDumpPath=logs/online-serving.hprof
-XX:ErrorFile=logs/hs_err_online-serving_pid%p.log
-Xlog:gc*,safepoint:file=logs/gc-online-serving-%p.log:time,uptime,level,tags:filecount=5,filesize=20M
